IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Spiritual-Resolve-for-Fearless-Living-at-E
 ternal-Gandhi-Museum-Houston.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/Spiritual-Resolve-for-Fearless-Living-at-Eternal-Gandhi-Museum-Ho
 uston.jpg
UID:2UV6dao5o-Z47QyP1e4kQ
SUMMARY:Spiritual Resolve for Fearless Living at Eternal Gandhi Museum Hous
	ton
DTSTAMP:20260810T042045Z
DTSTART:20260816T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Self Enquiry Life Fellowship presents Spiritual Resolve for Fea
	rless Living: Guided Meditation & Lecture by Himalayan Monk\, HH Swami Vid
	yadhishananda at Eternal Gandhi Museum Houston. \nHis Holiness Swami Vidya
	dhishananda\, a Himalayan monk and Sanskritist\, will lead a sacred Sunday
	 morning centered on the theme of spiritual resilience and resolve amidst 
	unstable times. \nThrough direct experience of guided meditation\, along w
	ith words of wisdom and spiritual advice\, guests will take home meaningfu
	l guidance about spiritual resolve and resilience amidst the challenges an
	d the difficult times ahead. \nThe fellowship invites all to discover the 
	steady ground of spiritual wisdom and contemplative practice\, timeless an
	chors that hold firm through any challenge. \nThe morning will open with s
	ublime Sanskrit chanting by His Holiness\, followed by guided meditation\,
	 words of wisdom\, a blessing line\, and more. \nA light Vegetarian lunch 
	will be provided in the foyer during the blessing line. \nDoors at 9:30am.
	 \nAdmission\nTickets are $15. Get tickets or learn more.This Featured Cal
	endar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our cale
	ndar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event
	\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttp
	s://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/spiritual-resolve-for-fearless-living-
	at-eternal-gandhi-museum-houston/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/spiritual-resolve-for-fearless-
	living-at-eternal-gandhi-museum-houston/
LOCATION:Eternal Gandhi Museum Houston\, 12379 Riceville School Rd\, Housto
	n\, 77031\, United States
